      "id": "claim_15b3bc080b674f18a4a995e40843858d",
      "statement": "DjimFlo is a research-grade agentic governance laboratory: a TypeScript npm-workspaces monorepo with a Node.js/Express + SQLite backend and a React dashboard for orchestrating AI coding agents, managing tasks across multiple runtimes, and governing agent behavior with approval workflows, policy enforcement, and audit trails.",
