    {
      "id": "claim_117a7c40ad8346f59b3acb8700f0954d",
      "statement": "The authoritative runtime is packages/server (@djimitflo/server). It boots from packages/server/src/index.ts, whose main() resolves the runtime profile, initializes the SQLite database, runs loop and task crash recovery, wires profile-gated services, mounts the composed API router under /api, attaches an authenticated WebSocket server at /ws, serves the dashboard statically, and shuts down gracefully on SIGTERM.",
