      "id": "claim_2c8912b359b64591a44cb8587e23ef3f",
      "statement": "DjimFlo applies an explicit epistemic discipline: 'immutable' means append-only at the SQLite trigger level (not externally anchored), 'sandboxed' means a Docker container with isolation flags (not gVisor/Kata), 'policy-enforced' means ToolBroker evaluates with enforcement limited to pre-execution, and 'production-grade' means research prototype not validated for enterprise production.",
      "evidence": [
